{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Pre-review mechanism remediation: split the terminal non-fast-forward exclusion into two machine-stable reasons. Existing `_POLICY_DECLINE_MARKERS` (GH013/hooks/branch protection) map to `push-policy-declined`; timeouts/network/other transport failures map to `push-transport-failed`. Tests must exercise both with the same exact git detail/unpushed-count contract. This preserves operational continuity while avoiding a new error vocabulary that erases the distinction bug 2a76 intentionally surfaced."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786146831572450001,"uuid":"fa87eb8d-f415-4207-b9e9-313d72c396b4"}